        "ごめんなさいね"
      ],
      "romanization": "gomen nasai",
      "meaning": "真心認錯，承認自己唔啱；比「すみません」重感情",
      "literal": "御免＝請寬免",
      "categories": {
        "age": [
          "kid",
          "teen",
          "young",
          "mid"
        ],
        "archetype": [
          "student"
        ],
        "tone": [
